; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026, at the backtest's costs (assumed 10 USD spread, no commission): this setup 26 trades, PF 1.76, net +6.0R; the 6 setups of this combination together 205 trades, PF 1.51 (stressed 1.43).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: 2024: this setup 47 trades, PF 0.41; 2023: this setup 55 trades, PF 0.83. The combination together: 2024 PF 1.10 (462 trades); 2023 PF 0.71 (425 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT M1 in broker server time, assumed spread 10 USD. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
